# Gradle and AGP outputs. One module's `build/` alone reaches ~90MB after a
# debug build.
#
# Matched per module rather than by name. These were pinned to `app/` and the
# native build moved to `bridge/` when the companion was split out of the shell,
# so 153 CMake and Ninja artifacts were tracked and churned on every build. A
# wildcard cannot be left behind by the next module that appears.
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/*/build/
android/*/.cxx/

# Machine-specific SDK path, written by scripts/setup-magdroid-build.sh.
android/local.properties

# Keep the wrapper jar. Upstream's ignore rules excluded it and it never made it
# into their repository, so a fresh clone could not run ./gradlew at all.
!android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Build-provisioned Cloudflare Access token, mirroring magios/Secrets.xcconfig.
android/secrets.properties

# Per-deployment Firebase routing identifiers. The generic companion does not
# embed one customer's push project.
android/app/google-services.json
